 private void initPlayer(){http=new DefaultHttpDataSource.Factory().setConnectTimeoutMs(12000).setReadTimeoutMs(20000).setAllowCrossProtocolRedirects(true);DefaultDataSource.Factory ds=new DefaultDataSource.Factory(this,http);player=new ExoPlayer.Builder(this).setMediaSourceFactory(new DefaultMediaSourceFactory(ds)).build();playerView.setPlayer(player);player.addListener(new Player.Listener(){@Override public void onPlaybackStateChanged(int s){loading.setVisibility(s==Player.STATE_BUFFERING?View.VISIBLE:View.GONE);}@Override public void onPlayerError(PlaybackException e){loading.setVisibility(View.GONE);Throwable cause=e.getCause();String httpStatus="n/a",contentType="n/a";if(cause instanceof androidx.media3.datasource.HttpDataSource.InvalidResponseCodeException){androidx.media3.datasource.HttpDataSource.InvalidResponseCodeException x=(androidx.media3.datasource.HttpDataSource.InvalidResponseCodeException)cause;httpStatus=String.valueOf(x.responseCode);java.util.List<String> ct=x.headerFields.get("Content-Type");if(ct!=null&&!ct.isEmpty())contentType=ct.get(0);}Log.e("LazyTV-Playback","SOURCE="+sourceName()+" HTTP_STATUS="+httpStatus+" FINAL_URL_HOST="+currentHost()+" REDIRECT_COUNT=Media3-managed CONTENT_TYPE="+contentType+" EXOPLAYER_ERROR_CODE="+e.errorCode+" EXOPLAYER_ERROR_NAME="+e.getErrorCodeName(),e);}});}
 private String sourceId(){return builtIn?"BUILTIN_LIVE":p.getId();} private String sourceName(){return builtIn?"BUILTIN_M3U":(p==null?"UNKNOWN":p.getType().name());}
 private String currentHost(){return resolvedHost;}
 private void load(){worker.execute(()->{try{Catalog c=builtIn?new TrialCatalogSource().load(this):engine.load(this,p);Map<String,List<StreamItem>> items=new HashMap<>();Map<String,Integer> counts=new HashMap<>();List<Category> liveCats=c.categories(CatalogType.LIVE);for(Category z:liveCats){List<StreamItem> li=c.items(CatalogType.LIVE,z.id);items.put(z.id,li);counts.put(z.id,li.size());}List<CountryGroup> grouped=CountryResolver.groups(liveCats);runOnUiThread(()->{catalog=c;liveItems.clear();liveItems.putAll(items);liveCounts.clear();liveCounts.putAll(counts);countries=new ArrayList<>(grouped);countrySpinner.setAdapter(spinnerAdapter(countryLabels()));if(!countries.isEmpty()){String wantedCategory=getIntent().getStringExtra("open_category_id"),wantedStream=getIntent().getStringExtra("open_stream_id");int cp=0;for(int n=0;n<countries.size();n++){for(Category z:countries.get(n).categories)if(z.id.equals(wantedCategory)){cp=n;break;}}countrySpinner.setSelection(cp);selectCountry(cp);if(wantedCategory!=null){for(int n=0;n<categories.size();n++)if(categories.get(n).id.equals(wantedCategory)){selectCategory(n,false);break;}if(wantedStream!=null){for(int n=0;n<shown.size();n++)if(shown.get(n).id.equals(wantedStream)){activateChannel(n,false);break;}}}else countrySpinner.requestFocus();}});}catch(Exception e){runOnUiThread(()->Toast.makeText(this,e.getMessage()==null?"Catalog error":e.getMessage(),Toast.LENGTH_LONG).show());}});}
 private List<String> countryLabels(){List<String>x=new ArrayList<>();for(CountryGroup g:countries){int n=0;for(Category z:g.categories)n+=liveCounts.getOrDefault(z.id,0);x.add(g.label+"  ("+n+")");}return x;}
 private List<String> categoryLabels(){List<String>x=new ArrayList<>();for(Category c:categories)x.add(CountryResolver.categoryLabel(c.name)+"  ("+liveCounts.getOrDefault(c.id,0)+")");return x;}
 private void selectCountry(int pos){if(pos<0||pos>=countries.size())return;country=countries.get(pos);categories=new ArrayList<>(country.categories);List<String>x=categoryLabels();categoriesView.setAdapter(adapter(x));overlayCategories.setAdapter(adapter(x));channels=Collections.emptyList();shown=new ArrayList<>();channelsView.setAdapter(channelAdapter());overlayChannels.setAdapter(channelAdapter());if(!x.isEmpty()){categoriesView.setSelection(0);categoriesView.requestFocus();}}
 private void selectCategory(int pos,boolean fromOverlay){if(pos<0||pos>=categories.size())return;category=categories.get(pos);channels=liveItems.getOrDefault(category.id,Collections.emptyList());filter("");if(fromOverlay){overlayChannels.requestFocus();if(!shown.isEmpty())overlayChannels.setSelection(0);}else{channelsView.requestFocus();if(!shown.isEmpty())channelsView.setSelection(0);}}
 private void filter(String q){q=q==null?"":q.trim().toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT);shown=new ArrayList<>();for(StreamItem i:channels)if(q.isEmpty()||(i.name!=null&&i.name.toLowerCase(Locale.ROOT).contains(q)))shown.add(i);channelsView.setAdapter(channelAdapter());overlayChannels.setAdapter(channelAdapter());}
 private List<String> channelLabels(){List<String>x=new ArrayList<>();for(int n=0;n<shown.size();n++){StreamItem i=shown.get(n);x.add(String.format(Locale.US,"%03d  %s",n+1,i.name));}return x;}
 private void activateChannel(int pos,boolean fromOverlay){if(pos<0||pos>=shown.size())return;StreamItem item=shown.get(pos);if(current!=null&&current.id.equals(item.id)){if(fromOverlay)hideOverlay();setFullscreen(true);return;}play(pos,fromOverlay);setFullscreen(true);}
 private void play(int pos,boolean fromOverlay){if(pos<0||pos>=shown.size())return;StreamItem item=shown.get(pos);loading.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);worker.execute(()->{try{ResolvedStream r=builtIn?new ResolvedStream(item.streamUrl,item.type.name(),item.name,item.logo,item.tvgId,null,null):engine.resolveStream(p,item);runOnUiThread(()->{playResolved(item,r);if(fromOverlay)hideOverlay();});}catch(Exception e){runOnUiThread(()->{loading.setVisibility(View.GONE);Toast.makeText(this,"Stream error",Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show();});}});}
 private void playResolved(StreamItem item,ResolvedStream r){idle.setVisibility(View.GONE);current=item;currentIndex=shown.indexOf(item);try{resolvedHost=new java.net.URL(r.url).getHost();}catch(Exception ignored){resolvedHost="n/a";}http.setDefaultRequestProperties(r.headers);MediaItem.Builder m=new MediaItem.Builder().setUri(Uri.parse(r.url));String u=r.url.toLowerCase(Locale.US);if(u.contains(".m3u8"))m.setMimeType(MimeTypes.APPLICATION_M3U8);else if(u.contains(".ts")||u.contains("extension=ts")||u.contains("extension=mpegts"))m.setMimeType(MimeTypes.VIDEO_MP2T);else if(u.contains(".mp4")||u.contains("extension=mp4"))m.setMimeType(MimeTypes.VIDEO_MP4);player.setMediaItem(m.build(),true);player.prepare();player.play();title.setText(item.name);String now=r.metadata.get("epg_now"),next=r.metadata.get("epg_next");epg.setText((now==null?"":"Now: "+now)+(next==null?"":"\\nNext: "+next));((Button)findViewById(R.id.live_favorite)).setText(favorites.contains(sourceId(),item)?"★ Favorite":"☆ Favorite");channelsView.invalidateViews();overlayChannels.invalidateViews();}
 private ArrayAdapter<String> spinnerAdapter(List<String>x){return new ArrayAdapter<String>(this,android.R.layout.simple_spinner_dropdown_item,x){public View getView(int p,View v,android.view.ViewGroup g){TextView t=(TextView)super.getView(p,v,g);t.setTextColor(android.graphics.Color.WHITE);t.setTextSize(15);t.setSingleLine(true);t.setPadding(10,8,8,8);return t;}public View getDropDownView(int p,View v,android.view.ViewGroup g){TextView t=(TextView)super.getDropDownView(p,v,g);t.setTextColor(android.graphics.Color.WHITE);t.setBackgroundColor(android.graphics.Color.rgb(7,21,34));t.setTextSize(16);t.setPadding(16,14,16,14);return t;}};}
 private ArrayAdapter<String> adapter(List<String>x){return new ArrayAdapter<String>(this,android.R.layout.simple_list_item_1,x){public View getView(int p,View v,android.view.ViewGroup g){TextView t=(TextView)super.getView(p,v,g);t.setTextColor(android.graphics.Color.WHITE);t.setTextSize(14);t.setSingleLine(true);t.setEllipsize(android.text.TextUtils.TruncateAt.END);t.setPadding(10,12,8,12);t.setFocusable(false);return t;}};}
 private android.widget.BaseAdapter channelAdapter(){return new android.widget.BaseAdapter(){public int getCount(){return shown.size();}public Object getItem(int n){return shown.get(n);}public long getItemId(int n){return n;}public View getView(int n,View v,android.view.ViewGroup parent){LinearLayout row=v instanceof LinearLayout?(LinearLayout)v:new LinearLayout(LiveTvActivity.this);row.removeAllViews();row.setOrientation(LinearLayout.HORIZONTAL);row.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER_VERTICAL);row.setPadding(8,6,8,6);row.setMinimumHeight((int)(52*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density));row.setBackgroundResource(R.drawable.bg_live_row);ImageView logo=new ImageView(LiveTvActivity.this);int sz=(int)(38*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density);row.addView(logo,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(sz,sz));TextView t=new TextView(LiveTvActivity.this);StreamItem i=shown.get(n);t.setText(String.format(Locale.US,"%03d  %s",n+1,i.name));t.setTextColor(android.graphics.Color.WHITE);t.setTextSize(14);t.setSingleLine(true);t.setEllipsize(android.text.TextUtils.TruncateAt.END);LinearLayout.LayoutParams tp=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,LinearLayout.LayoutParams.WRAP_CONTENT,1);tp.leftMargin=8;row.addView(t,tp);logo.setScaleType(ImageView.ScaleType.CENTER_INSIDE);if(i.logo!=null&&!i.logo.trim().isEmpty())loadLogo(logo,i.logo);else Base64AssetImage.load(LiveTvActivity.this,logo,"lazytv_official_logo.png.b64");row.setActivated(current!=null&&current.id.equals(i.id));return row;}};}
 private void loadLogo(ImageView v,String url){v.setTag(url);Base64AssetImage.load(this,v,"lazytv_official_logo.png.b64");imageWorker.execute(()->{java.net.HttpURLConnection cn=null;try{cn=(java.net.HttpURLConnection)new java.net.URL(url).openConnection();cn.setInstanceFollowRedirects(true);cn.setRequestProperty("User-Agent","Mozilla/5.0 LazyTV-PRO");cn.setRequestProperty("Accept","image/*,*/*;q=0.8");cn.setConnectTimeout(6000);cn.setReadTimeout(8000);android.graphics.Bitmap b=android.graphics.BitmapFactory.decodeStream(cn.getInputStream());if(b!=null)runOnUiThread(()->{if(url.equals(v.getTag()))v.setImageBitmap(b);});}catch(Exception ignored){runOnUiThread(()->{if(url.equals(v.getTag()))Base64AssetImage.load(LiveTvActivity.this,v,"lazytv_official_logo.png.b64");});}finally{if(cn!=null)cn.disconnect();}});}
 private void setFullscreen(boolean on){fullscreen=on;if(on){topBar.setVisibility(View.GONE);bottomBar.setVisibility(View.GONE);contentRow.setPadding(0,0,0,0);leftPanel.setVisibility(View.GONE);channelPanel.setVisibility(View.GONE);info.setVisibility(View.GONE);View panel=findViewById(R.id.live_player_panel);android.widget.LinearLayout.LayoutParams fp=(android.widget.LinearLayout.LayoutParams)panel.getLayoutParams();fp.width=0;fp.weight=1;fp.height=android.view.ViewGroup.LayoutParams.MATCH_PARENT;fp.setMargins(0,0,0,0);panel.setLayoutParams(fp);root.setPadding(0,0,0,0);playerView.setResizeMode(androidx.media3.ui.AspectRatioFrameLayout.RESIZE_MODE_ZOOM);getWindow().setFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_FULLSCREEN,WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_FULLSCREEN);getWindow().getDecorView().setSystemUiVisibility(View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_FULLSCREEN|View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_HIDE_NAVIGATION|View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_IMMERSIVE_STICKY|View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_FULLSCREEN|View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_HIDE_NAVIGATION|View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_STABLE);playerView.requestFocus();}else{hideOverlay();topBar.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);bottomBar.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);contentRow.setPadding((int)(8*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),(int)(8*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),(int)(8*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),(int)(8*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density));View panel=findViewById(R.id.live_player_panel);android.widget.LinearLayout.LayoutParams fp=(android.widget.LinearLayout.LayoutParams)panel.getLayoutParams();fp.width=0;fp.weight=50;fp.height=android.view.ViewGroup.LayoutParams.MATCH_PARENT;fp.setMargins((int)(5*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),0,0,0);panel.setLayoutParams(fp);root.setPadding((int)(6*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),(int)(6*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),(int)(6*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density),(int)(6*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density));leftPanel.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);channelPanel.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);info.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);playerView.setResizeMode(androidx.media3.ui.AspectRatioFrameLayout.RESIZE_MODE_FIT);getWindow().clearFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_FULLSCREEN);getWindow().getDecorView().setSystemUiVisibility(View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_VISIBLE);if(!shown.isEmpty())channelsView.requestFocus();else if(category!=null)categoriesView.requestFocus();else countrySpinner.requestFocus();}}
 private void openCatalogType(String type){if(p==null){Toast.makeText(this,type+" kërkon provider me katalog",Toast.LENGTH_SHORT).show();return;}android.content.Intent i=new android.content.Intent(this,de.lazytv.pro.catalog.CatalogActivity.class);i.putExtra("playlist_id",p.getId());i.putExtra(de.lazytv.pro.catalog.CatalogActivity.EXTRA_TYPE,type);startActivity(i);}
 private void playAdjacent(int delta){if(shown.isEmpty()||current==null)return;int i=currentIndex>=0?currentIndex:shown.indexOf(current);if(i<0)return;int n=(i+delta+shown.size())%shown.size();play(n,true);}
 private void toggleOverlay(){if(!fullscreen)return;if(overlayOpen)hideOverlay();else showOverlay();}
 private void showOverlay(){if(!fullscreen)return;overlayOpen=true;overlay.setVisibility(View.VISIBLE);FrameLayout.LayoutParams lp=(FrameLayout.LayoutParams)overlay.getLayoutParams();lp.width=(int)(getResources().getDisplayMetrics().widthPixels*.42f);overlay.setLayoutParams(lp);if(category!=null){overlayCategories.setAdapter(adapter(categoryLabels()));overlayChannels.setAdapter(adapter(channelLabels()));overlayChannels.requestFocus();}else overlayCategories.requestFocus();}
 private void hideOverlay(){overlayOpen=false;overlay.setVisibility(View.GONE);if(fullscreen)playerView.requestFocus();}
 @Override public void onBackPressed(){if(overlayOpen){hideOverlay();return;}if(fullscreen){setFullscreen(false);return;}super.onBackPressed();}
 @Override public boolean dispatchKeyEvent(KeyEvent e){if(e.getAction()==KeyEvent.ACTION_DOWN&&!fullscreen){int k=e.getKeyCode();if(k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_DPAD_RIGHT&&categoriesView.hasFocus()){channelsView.requestFocus();return true;}if(k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_DPAD_LEFT&&channelsView.hasFocus()){categoriesView.requestFocus();return true;}if(k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_DPAD_RIGHT&&channelsView.hasFocus()){playerView.requestFocus();return true;}if(k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_DPAD_LEFT&&playerView.hasFocus()){channelsView.requestFocus();return true;}}if(e.getAction()==KeyEvent.ACTION_DOWN&&fullscreen){int k=e.getKeyCode();if((k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_DPAD_CENTER||k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_ENTER)&&!overlayOpen){toggleOverlay();return true;}if(!overlayOpen&&(k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_CHANNEL_UP||k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_MEDIA_NEXT)){playAdjacent(1);return true;}if(!overlayOpen&&(k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_CHANNEL_DOWN||k==KeyEvent.KEYCODE_MEDIA_PREVIOUS)){playAdjacent(-1);return true;}}return super.dispatchKeyEvent(e);}
 protected void onDestroy(){if(player!=null){playerView.setPlayer(null);player.release();}worker.shutdownNow();imageWorker.shutdownNow();engine.close();super.onDestroy();}
